  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1341120512
    m_Localized: Mejnun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695204831232
    m_Localized: Automatic (device language)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1656669331456
    m_Localized: OK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1656690302976
    m_Localized: Cancel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1656690302977
    m_Localized: Back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1656690302978
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1656690302979
    m_Localized: On
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1656690302980
    m_Localized: Off
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1656690302981
    m_Localized: Yes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1656690302982
    m_Localized: No
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1656690302983
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1656690302984
    m_Localized: Done
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1656690302985
    m_Localized: Locked
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1656690302986
    m_Localized: "Loading\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548909711360
    m_Localized: Welcome to Mejnun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548981014528
    m_Localized: 'Mejnun is played with two full decks: 104 cards. Everyone is dealt
      11. Be the first to empty your hand onto the table to win.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548981014529
    m_Localized: Sets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548981014530
    m_Localized: Cards go on the table in sets. A same kind is 3 or 4 cards of one
      rank, all different suits. A straight is 3 or more cards of one suit, in order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548981014531
    m_Localized: '{0}''s turn'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548985208832
    m_Localized: '{0} goes first. Watch what she does.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548985208833
    m_Localized: '{0} is Down'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548985208834
    m_Localized: '{0} put down a set made only from her hand. That''s called going
      Down, and one set is enough.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548985208835
    m_Localized: You're not Down yet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208836
    m_Localized: You can't use the table until you're Down. First, put down a set
      from your own hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208837
    m_Localized: Go Down first
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208838
    m_Localized: "Until you're Down you can only play sets from your own hand. Put
      7\u2665 8\u2665 9\u2665 on the empty table."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208839
    m_Localized: "Keep going\u2014finish placing all three cards from your hand to
      go Down."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208840
    m_Localized: You're Down!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208841
    m_Localized: 'Now the whole table is yours to use: add to any set, rearrange,
      split. And you can keep playing this same turn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208842
    m_Localized: Add to a set
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208843
    m_Localized: "Now put your A\u2660 on {0}'s J\u2660 Q\u2660 K\u2660."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548985208844
    m_Localized: Aces
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208845
    m_Localized: An ace can be low (A-2-3) or high (Q-K-A), but a straight never
      wraps around (K-A-2).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208846
    m_Localized: Same kind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208847
    m_Localized: "Put 5\u2663 5\u2666 5\u2660 on the empty table."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208848
    m_Localized: "Keep going\u2014finish placing all three cards."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208849
    m_Localized: Doubles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208850
    m_Localized: 'With two decks every card has a double: same suit and rank, from
      the other deck (its card back looks different). A double can never go in the
      same set.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208851
    m_Localized: End your turn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208852
    m_Localized: You can end your turn when every set on the table is valid and you've
      played at least one card from your hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208853
    m_Localized: Watch {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548985208854
    m_Localized: Any set is fair game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208855
    m_Localized: "{0} added 10\u2665 J\u2665 to your hearts and 5\u2665 to your fives.
      Once you're Down you can add to any set on the table."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548985208856
    m_Localized: Split a straight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208857
    m_Localized: "Long-press the 10\u2665 and drag it to the empty table. The 10\u2665
      J\u2665 come with it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208858
    m_Localized: Not a set yet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208859
    m_Localized: "10\u2665 J\u2665 has a red outline: it isn't a valid set. That's
      fine in the middle of a turn, but you can't end your turn until every set is
      valid."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208860
    m_Localized: Use your double
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208861
    m_Localized: "Put your 9\u2665 on 10\u2665 J\u2665. It's the double of the 9\u2665
      in the other set, so it's allowed here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208862
    m_Localized: Undo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208863
    m_Localized: Made a mistake? Undo steps back one move. Try it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208864
    m_Localized: Redo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208865
    m_Localized: Redo puts the move back. Revert resets the whole turn, and Fix board
      tries to repair the table for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208866
    m_Localized: Every set is valid again. End your turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208867
    m_Localized: '{0} drew'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548985208868
    m_Localized: '{0} couldn''t play, so she drew. Drawing takes one card from the
      pile and ends your turn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548985208869
    m_Localized: Start a group
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208870
    m_Localized: "Put 3\u2665 4\u2665 on the empty table. It's only two cards, so
      it shows red for now."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208871
    m_Localized: "Keep going\u2014finish placing both cards."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208872
    m_Localized: Borrow from a set
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208873
    m_Localized: "A four of a kind still works with three. Drag the 5\u2665 out of
      the fives onto 3\u2665 4\u2665."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208874
    m_Localized: All sets are valid. End your turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208875
    m_Localized: One card left!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208876
    m_Localized: "When a player is down to their last card, their seat shakes and
      shows a ! \u2014 everyone can see they're about to win."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208877
    m_Localized: New sets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208878
    m_Localized: Players who are Down can also start brand-new sets from their hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208879
    m_Localized: Stuck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208880
    m_Localized: "Your A\u2665 doesn't fit anywhere on the table."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208881
    m_Localized: Draw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208882
    m_Localized: Tap Draw to take a card and end your turn. Drawing also returns
      any cards you placed this turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208883
    m_Localized: '{0} is stuck too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548985208884
    m_Localized: "You drew the 2\u2665"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208885
    m_Localized: "Put the 2\u2665 on 3\u2665 4\u2665 5\u2665."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208886
    m_Localized: Ace low
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208887
    m_Localized: "Now the A\u2665 fits at the low end: A-2-3-4-5\u2665. Play your
      last card!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208888
    m_Localized: MEJNUN!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208889
    m_Localized: You emptied your hand and won. A few more things are good to know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208890
    m_Localized: Same kind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208891
    m_Localized: Straight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208892
    m_Localized: Mixed suits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208893
    m_Localized: Low
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548985208894
    m_Localized: High
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403136
    m_Localized: No wrap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403137
    m_Localized: A double
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403138
    m_Localized: Same set
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403139
    m_Localized: Empty draw pile
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403140
    m_Localized: When the draw pile runs out, Draw becomes Pass. If everyone passes
      in a row, the player with the fewest cards wins. A tie is a Stalemate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403141
    m_Localized: Timed turns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403142
    m_Localized: "In timed games a clock counts down each turn. When it runs out
      \u2014 Halas! \u2014 a valid turn ends, otherwise your cards go back and you
      draw."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403143
    m_Localized: Fix board and Revert
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403144
    m_Localized: Fix board tries to make every set valid while keeping your moves.
      Revert puts the whole table back to how it was at the start of your turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403145
    m_Localized: Hints and the table
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403146
    m_Localized: Hints outline cards you can play. Pinch to zoom, drag to pan, and
      use Fit to see the whole table.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403147
    m_Localized: Next game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403148
    m_Localized: The winner goes first in the next game.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403149
    m_Localized: Layla
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403150
    m_Localized: You
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403151
    m_Localized: Player {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548989403152
    m_Localized: Bot {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548989403153
    m_Localized: '{0} (Easy bot)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548989403154
    m_Localized: '{0} (Medium bot)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548989403155
    m_Localized: '{0} (Hard bot)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548989403156
    m_Localized: "Pass to {0} \u2014 tap to reveal"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548989403157
    m_Localized: Stalemate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403158
    m_Localized: '{0} wins!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548989403159
    m_Localized: Game over
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403160
    m_Localized: '{0} emptied their hand.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548989403161
    m_Localized: '{0} had the fewest cards when the draw pile ran out.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548989403162
    m_Localized: The fewest-card score was tied. Pick who goes first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403163
    m_Localized: Who should go first?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403164
    m_Localized: Match paused
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403165
    m_Localized: Match resumed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403166
    m_Localized: Host disconnected
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403167
    m_Localized: '{0} joined'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548989403168
    m_Localized: '{0} disconnected'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548989403169
    m_Localized: All players joined
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403170
    m_Localized: '{0} is now the host'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548989403171
    m_Localized: A player is now the host
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403172
    m_Localized: "Waiting for players ({0}/{1})\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548989403173
    m_Localized: "Waiting for players ({0}/{1})\u2026\nRoom code: {2}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4825848250262618112
  - m_Id: 6548989403174
    m_Localized: A player disconnected
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403175
    m_Localized: Wait for them, let a Medium bot take over, or save and pause.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403176
    m_Localized: Wait / auto-pass
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403177
    m_Localized: Let AI take over
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403178
    m_Localized: Save and pause
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403179
    m_Localized: Match saved and paused
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403180
    m_Localized: The host can resume this session when everyone is ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6548989403181
    m_Localized: Resume match
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
