  - m_Id: 74273250074639
    m_Localized: Hella!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74273250074640
    m_Localized: Hecka!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010752
    m_Localized: Bad!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010753
    m_Localized: Not there!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010754
    m_Localized: What were you thinking?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010755
    m_Localized: How could you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010756
    m_Localized: Straight to jail...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010757
    m_Localized: That's illegal...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010758
    m_Localized: I don't understand you...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010759
    m_Localized: You think like a hamster...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010760
    m_Localized: Somebody has a case of the mondays...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010761
    m_Localized: Oof...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010762
    m_Localized: Big oof...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010763
    m_Localized: Biggest oof...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010764
    m_Localized: Small oof...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010765
    m_Localized: Shame...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010766
    m_Localized: ERROR! INFERIOR INTELLIGENCE DETECTED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010767
    m_Localized: My cat can play better than that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010768
    m_Localized: Huh...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010769
    m_Localized: Well I didn't expect that...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010770
    m_Localized: Ummm...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010771
    m_Localized: Well that could have gone better...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010772
    m_Localized: Hide opponent hands between turns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010773
    m_Localized: Moves opponent hands partly offscreen until their next turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010774
    m_Localized: Edge pan area width
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010775
    m_Localized: Controls how far from the left, right, and top edges a drag starts
      panning the board; set to 0 to disable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74274328010776
    m_Localized: Play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
